{"meta":{"ph":"ˈsəʊʃəlɪst; NAmE ˈsoʊʃəlɪst","pos":"noun","stars":"★★"},"defs":[{"def":"a person who believes in or supports socialism; a member of a political party that believes in socialism 社会主义者；社会党党员adj.","ex":[{"s":"But now, interviews can be done online … More than 40 years ago, China began to implement the reform and opening-up policy, starting out on a journey that would pave the way for China to become a fully-modernised socialist country.","src":"外研社B5 U3","cat":"waiyan","t":"但现在,采访可以在网上进行. . 40多年前,中国开始实施改革开放政策,开始踏上为中国成为一个完全现代化的社会主义国家铺平道路的旅程."},{"s":"The geophysicist Huang Danian, who practised core socialist values, is a good example.","src":"译林选必4 U1","cat":"yilin","t":"奉行社会主义核心价值观的地球物理学家黄丹良是一个很好的例子."}]}]}